codex
One final semantic refinement is warranted: the K projections and `intOf` are defined only on their guarded sorts, while Lean requires total functions. I’m giving independently defined off-domain completions to the corresponding symbols so the proof must genuinely use each frozen guard; on-domain behavior remains exactly the frozen constructor projection/conversion.
